//! The bridge from a deck's text to what the GUI shows: geometry, model checks, variables, and
//! a solution with its radiation pattern. Sweeps and the optimizer come straight from
//! [`nec_engine`]. Plain Rust with no Tauri types, so it can be tested on its own.

